UnitPaymentBrokerRefusal
├── when an allowed message reaches the hub
│   ├── given a hub that refuses the payment
│   │   └── it records Rejected with the hub error selector and creates no payment
│   ├── given a rejected message and a topped up budget
│   │   └── it reverts with PaymentBroker_MessageAlreadyProcessed
│   ├── given a messenger that reverts
│   │   └── it records Accepted and emits DispatchFailed with the payment pending
│   └── given a payment left pending by a failed dispatch
│       └── it can be dispatched by anyone before its deadline and refunded after it
└── when the gas left is low
    ├── given less than MIN_RELAY_GAS at the hub call
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentBroker_InsufficientGas and records no status
    └── given the same message redelivered with enough gas
        └── it is processed
